{"title":"2020 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 1a","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2020 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/1/f71d74d90f04d0fa1dd2e326d6cf9575e308e790.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"51\" height=\"12\" />, what is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/f/c2fa0e13755b5d2f95c72ed22a92fefd40ca4300.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3x + 6}{x + 2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"57\" height=\"40\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/1/df19074c57a7ac2c3e780bbcb54e646493df73e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=11$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"51\" height=\"12\" />, we can get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/8/8780d52d49519d8c98f5fe7c9168ce9dcdde26af.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3(11)+6}{11+2}=\\frac{39}{13}=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"158\" height=\"42\" />. Therefore, our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/3/433d742232f7bf3512c11eb996630ff5ead3641f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"20\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p><p>~originally by Yuhao2012\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Without plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/1/f71d74d90f04d0fa1dd2e326d6cf9575e308e790.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"51\" height=\"12\" />, we can realize that:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/3/873fb9ed2250d74a72a9f28e8354b16757ff55e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3x + 6}{x + 2} = \\frac{3(x + 2)}{x + 2} = \\boxed{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"194\" height=\"42\" />\n</p><p>This also means that the answer does not change, no matter what the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018012614\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.010 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.014 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 47/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 78/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1501/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.878      1 2020_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1\n100.00%    5.878      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:35890:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018012614 and revision id 279164. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}